  "sent_to_model": "need a bit of a write up, one page doc type thing for my mate Lee who i do the bigger jobs with. Im trying to talk him into going halves on a secondhand dumper instead of hiring one every time, hes a bit tight and he'll want to see the sums. He reads stuff proper if its written down rather than me going on at him in the van. figures are below, we've known each other 15 yrs. tell him how we'd split the running costs and get him to come look at it Saturday with me, thats all below\n\n- hired the tracked dumper 14 days this year from the hire place in Sittingbourne, 85 quid a day plus 30 delivery each time, roughly 1600 all in\n- bloke in Faversham selling a 2019 500kg tracked one, 1650 ono, says new tracks fitted last spring\n- halves = 825 each, can keep it in my lean-to at the yard, its covered\n- got 3 patio digs and the Boughton drive booked in for spring already\n- in Sept hire place didnt have one so we barrowed 6 ton of muck at the Hernhill job, took 2 extra days and Lees back was gone for a week\n- delivery driver turned up at 11 once, lost half the morning\n- pays for itself in about a year at this year's use, about two years at half that use, before servicing and repairs\n- can sell it on if it doesnt work out, they hold value\n- get Lee to come look at it with me this Saturday before someone else has it\n- sort servicing 50/50 and whoever breaks it pays\n\n(About me: self-employed landscape gardener, 46, Kent, England. Length: it should come to roughly 250-400 words.)",
